          "help": "Software-only bipolar full-span scale factor used by uz_adcLtc2311_convert_raw_to_physical_value(). It does not configure the IP core. The raw ADC value is treated as signed int16_t differential/bipolar data. The formula is raw / 65536.0f * full_span_factor, so a factor of 10.0f maps the signed range approximately to -5.0 ... +5.0."
        },
        {
